{"duration": 75.083, "lines": [{"id": "h1", "t0": 0.35, "t1": 4.933, "cap": "Baru bangun... *udah ada lagu*"}, {"id": "h2", "t0": 5.133, "t1": 8.467, "cap": "Itu-itu aja. *Nggak suka pula!*"}, {"id": "h3", "t0": 8.767, "t1": 11.683, "cap": "Obatnya? *Permen karet.*"}, {"id": "k1", "t0": 12.083, "t1": 16.667, "cap": "Namanya: *earworm* (cacing telinga)"}, {"id": "k2", "t0": 16.917, "t1": 23.167, "cap": "Potongan pendek, *diulang terus*"}, {"id": "k3", "t0": 23.417, "t1": 25.917, "cap": "Dilupain... *malah muter lagi*"}, {"id": "a1", "t0": 26.817, "t1": 30.15, "cap": "Waktu kami di *Adriy.Project* nemu penelitiannya..."}, {"id": "a1b", "t0": 31.05, "t1": 32.717, "cap": "...jawabannya bikin *ngakak.*"}, {"id": "f1", "t0": 33.067, "t1": 39.733, "cap": "Univ. Reading: *98 orang* disetel lagu nyangkut"}, {"id": "f2", "t0": 39.933, "t1": 43.267, "cap": "Sebagian *ngunyah permen karet*"}, {"id": "f3", "t0": 43.567, "t1": 47.733, "cap": "Hasil: lagunya *lebih jarang muncul!*"}, {"id": "x1", "t0": 48.133, "t1": 54.8, "cap": "Ngunyah = *\"mulut dalam hati\" sibuk*"}, {"id": "x2", "t0": 55.05, "t1": 56.717, "cap": "Mulut sibuk, *konser bubar!*"}, {"id": "s1", "t0": 57.217, "t1": 61.8, "cap": "Lagu bandel? *Kunyah permen karet*"}, {"id": "c1", "t0": 62.3, "t1": 67.3, "cap": "Lagu apa yang nyangkut? *Tulis di komentar!*"}, {"id": "c2", "t0": 67.55, "t1": 70.467, "cap": "*Ikuti* biar nggak ketinggalan"}, {"id": "z", "t0": 70.917, "t1": 72.583, "cap": ""}], "perkiraan": true}